            "review_text": "Flavors of Hanoi\nHanoi, Vietnam42 contributions\n1\nFrozen Seafood\nSep 2018 • Couples\nAbout 30 minutes walk from the city center and cross the Tran Phu bridge, this is one of many seafood places on Thap Ba street (same street to the Ponagar Temple). \n\nI got recommended to come here for fresh seafood, but vert disappointed. Except the lobster and some shells, squid and shrimps are all frozen. We saw the owner put a lot of frozen seafood into the water before showing it to clients.\nRead more\nWritten September 8, 2018",
