            "review_text": "winniepleong\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia44 contributions\n0\nOysters are fresh\nApr 2018 • Family\nHad mantis prawns 350k 1kg, oysters 100k 1kg, clams 350k 1kg. Oysters were fresh and the size is 👌. Not too big and had them raw on ice. Mantis prawn were nicely cooked in pepper salt. Google maps are accurate. Walked there from Po Nagar\nWritten April 9, 2018",
